# Project Structure & Technologies

## Overview

This project contains two primary subdirectories:

- [`api`](mdc:api): Backend, built with [NestJS](https://nestjs.com/), Prisma ORM for PostgreSQL, and TypeScript.
- [`app`](mdc:app): Frontend, built with [Expo](https://expo.dev/), React Native, TypeScript, and React Navigation.

## Details

### [`api`](mdc:api)

- `src/`: Main NestJS app source (controllers, services, modules).
- `prisma/`: Prisma schema and migrations for PostgreSQL.
- `generated/prisma/`: Auto-generated Prisma client.
- `test/`: Test files.
- `dist/`: Build output (ignore for source edits).
- Uses scripts and config for linting, building, and running via npm.

### [`app`](mdc:app)

- `app/`: Main app entry, routing, and screens (file-based routing with Expo Router).
- `components/`: Reusable React components (UI, utility, etc).
- `assets/`: Images and other static files.
- `constants/`, `hooks/`: Utility files for UI/theme/hooks.
- Scripts for running, building, and linting the React Native app.
